Z||000025||151 in. of love||02-20-2001||07:31 PM||||Thank you for your condolences.<P>The police showed up within 60 seconds of me calling 911. When they got there I asked them to get the extinguisher out of their squad. I have seen them in there before. <P>He tells me "No Way Son, The Fire Department Is On Their Way"<P>Well a lot of good they were..<P>Then the insurance agent comes over and acts like it's a business. He tells me that it isn't covered if I'm running a business. Acting as if I'm running a proprietorship or something. <P>He's treating me like I'm the one who is trying to screw the company. I don't like to be treated as though I'm being dishonest. <P>The first words that came out of his mouth were "You Know, None Of The Motor Vehicles Are Going To Be Covered." <P>Then while I was looking at the car damage I see A HUGE HOLE IN THE TRUNK!! Where apparenntly an axe had been slammed into the trunklid. NICE..REAL F-kn NICE...<P>So- I guess I won't be comming here anymore, (unless I get another Fiero). So maybe you haven't heard the last from me yet. <P>Thanks for lettin' me vent..||||reg||8
