Z||000039||Kilodyne||02-22-2001||05:07 PM||||That sucks..<BR>My first car, an 82 bmw caught fire a 7 months after i got it.  seems some idiot spliced a battery cable with a piece of metal. It eventualy shorted out and my car was toast.. litterally.  there are some real idiots out there. sorry you had to meet them 151.  Now i can add volunteer firemen and state farm insurance reps to the list.  Good luck!||||reg||9
